Error [E0036]: Jet uses the trait name directly, not `dyn`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_dyn.jet:5:14
    |
  5 | fn by_dyn(s: dyn Shape) {
    |              ^^^
 Why: a trait in type position means dynamic dispatch — Jet handles the details for you
 Fix: write the trait name, like `Shape` or `List<Shape>`

